  "description": "After being together for 9 years, Geurim and her boyfriend had lost their spark, leading her to travel to Paris on a package holiday on impulse. Upon her arrival at the airport, Geurim had been waiting for her luggage when she spotted it and reached out her hand… but it brushed against another belonging to a handsome man, who had reached out for the same luggage. Geurim decided to put her excitement aside and enjoy her trip instead, but the man assigned as her partner turned out to be terrible! He didn’t seem to like her either, and went away. In the meantime, Geurim bumped into the man from the airport, who unexpectedly proposed to go around together… Will the two of them be able to stand by themselves by the end of this?\n\n(Source: BOMTOON, translated)",
